# OneBoard Telegram bot — credentials + board address.
# NEVER commit this file, and never paste tokens in chat.
#
# 1) Create the bot: talk to @BotFather on Telegram -> /newbot -> name + username
#    -> it gives you a token (format 123456:ABC...).
# 2) Put that token here, uncomment, and set the allowed user id (Brad's is
#    8752323636 per wiki; the bot only answers users on this list).
# 3) Install + start the service (see README):
#    systemctl --user daemon-reload
#    systemctl --user enable --now hermes-gateway-oneboard
#
# NOTE: board IP is DHCP (currently 192.168.1.206) — update if it changes,
# or give the board a DHCP reservation on the router.

#ONBOARD_BOT_TOKEN=123456:REPLACE_ME
#ONBOARD_BOARD_IP=192.168.1.206
#ONBOARD_STORE_URL=http://192.168.1.169:8082
#ONBOARD_ALLOWED=8752323636
